  "limits": "Every worker inherits affinity [0,1], CPU120 seconds, AS6GiB before execution; writer tightens to CPU10/AS512MiB. Each command external timeout140. Guard polls observed descendants at .01s and kills worker at >6GiB sampled sum or >130s elapsed. Samples are not complete group or cgroup guarantees. Workers and writer children waited/reaped.",
